      "id": 225,
      "start": 655.4,
      "end": 660.0,
      "en": "There was no popcorn, no soda, no candy inside the movie theater.",
      "zh": "电影院里没有爆米花，没有苏打水，没有糖果。"
    },
    {
      "id": 226,
      "start": 660.0,
      "end": 660.62,
      "en": "Can you imagine that?",
      "zh": "你能想象吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 227,
      "start": 660.84,
      "end": 667.68,
      "en": "I could not live with that because the whole purpose of going to the movies is to have some popcorn and relax and have a good time.",
      "zh": "我无法忍受，因为去看电影的全部目的是吃点爆米花，放松一下，玩得开心。"
    },
    {
      "id": 228,
      "start": 667.8,
      "end": 669.32,
      "en": "You can't have a movie without popcorn.",
      "zh": "没有爆米花就不能拍电影。"
    },
    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 669.42,
      "end": 669.62,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 670.58,
      "end": 679.04,
      "en": "Okay, so we've talked a lot about how to ask someone to be quiet today, and I hope that you'll go out and try a few of these phrases in your daily life.",
      "zh": "好的，所以我们已经谈了很多关于如何让某人保持安静的话题，我希望你能在日常生活中尝试一些这样的短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 679.32,
      "end": 685.78,
      "en": "Yes, and I hope also that you visit our website at EnglishPod.com and leave all your questions and comments.",
      "zh": "是的，我也希望您访问我们的网站 englishpod.com 并留下您的所有问题和意见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 686.36,
      "end": 691.68,
      "en": "Marco and I are there every day, so we'll be happy to answer your questions, but until next time, bye!",
      "zh": "Marco 和我每天都在那里，所以我们很乐意回答您的问题，但直到下一次，再见！"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 691.68,
      "end": 700.891,
      "en": "Bye!",
      "zh": "再见！"
    }
  ],
